  "title": "Fuse Energy delivers super cheap EV charging with Enode",
  "summary": "Fuse is the fastest growing energy retailer in the UK for a reason. They offer some of the most competitive fixed and time-of-use (ToU) tariffs on the market, alongside a seamless switching experience through the Fuse app and web. Now, Fuse is partnering with Enode to take that experience even further, bringing intelligent EV charging and public charging features to EV owners across the UK.",
